      "content": "Thanks, this is a really solid start. It sounds professional and flows well without feeling forced. \n\nI just ran it through a dry run of our internal tool to see where we'd land on the pre-screening stage, and we're sitting at around a 0.57 score. It's okay, but honestly, if we don't get that score higher, we might not even make it past the automated filter to reach the humans. \n\nCould you try a second draft? I definitely still need it to be high-quality and persuasive, but try to weave those priority terms in a bit more frequently so we can push that score closer to 1.0. Just please make sure it still reads like a natural, human-written proposal and not a list of buzzwords.",
